From 46773171b85f3622a48a756724c49fdb068c81ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Academia Helm Dev <dev@academiahelm.com>
Date: Fri, 26 Jun 2026 22:12:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix: critical build errors + STE V2 integration
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

CRITICAL FIXES (blocked both Vercel + Fly.io deployments):
- prisma/schema.prisma: duplicate TeacherAvailability model (line 1134 + 7789)
  renamed STE-side to TimetableTeacherAvailability (same @@map table name,
  so raw SQL in timetable-engine.service.ts continues to work)
- SubjectsWorkspace.tsx: 3 unclosed braces in pedagogyFetch POST/PATCH calls
  (lines 493, 527, 581) caused 'Expected comma got )' Turbopack parse error.
  Also removed unused BilingualTrack import (TS2305).

STE V2 INTEGRATION (replaces V1):
- Backend timetable-engine.service.ts: +getTeachers, +getTeachersWithAvailability,
  +deleteAvailability, generate() upgraded to CSP V2 with slot ranking by
  preference (PREFERRED first, AVAILABLE next, UNAVAILABLE/FORBIDDEN skipped).
  3 new dynamic scorers: preferenceScore (% PREFERRED used),
  pedagogyScore (per-teacher daily load balance), comfortScore (AM/PM balance).
- Backend timetable-engine.controller.ts: +GET /teachers, +DELETE /availability/:id
- Frontend TimetablesWorkspace.tsx: 5-tab STE V2 interface
  (Config / Disponibilités / Génération / Solutions / Édition manuelle).
  Real availability grid (3-state toggle: AVAILABLE/PREFERRED/UNAVAILABLE),
  no more V1 placeholder. Bulk actions per day. Optimistic updates.
- Frontend ManualTimetablesEditor.tsx: legacy visual editor preserved as 5th tab.
  Fixed fetchEntries() (undefined) → loadEntries() call.
- Frontend timetables/page.tsx: dynamic KPIs from STE solutions endpoint.
- Frontend timetable-engine/page.tsx: redirect to /timetables (STE integrated).
- Frontend api/timetable-engine/[[...path]]/route.ts: +DELETE handler.
